---
import LawLayout from "../../../components/law/LawLayout.astro";
---

<LawLayout title="About Washington Law | Seattle Boutique Law Firm Since 2009" description="Founded in 2009 by Meg Harrington, Washington Law is a Seattle boutique firm built on the belief that Pacific Northwest businesses and families deserve elite legal counsel without the big-firm overhead.">
	<div class="pt-32 pb-24">
		<div class="container mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6">
			<div class="mb-24 grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-16 lg:grid-cols-2">
				<div>
					<p class="mb-4 font-sans text-sm font-bold tracking-widest text-accent uppercase">Our Story</p>
					<h1 class="font-display mb-8 text-5xl leading-tight font-semibold text-primary lg:text-6xl">A boutique firm built for Pacific Northwest builders.</h1>
					<div class="space-y-6 font-serif text-lg leading-relaxed text-[#2e2e2e]">
						<p>Washington Law was founded on a belief that has never gone out of style: that exceptional legal work, delivered by attorneys who genuinely know their clients, produces better outcomes than any high-volume, assembly-line firm ever could.</p>
						<p>For over fifteen years, our eight-attorney team has served Pacific Northwest businesses, families, and individuals with the strategic precision of a large firm and the personal attention you only find at a boutique.</p>
						<p class="font-medium text-primary">We are not the biggest firm in Seattle. We are exactly the right size to know you, fight for you, and win.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="relative h-[600px]">
					<img src="/images/law/about-pnw.png" alt="Pacific Northwest Office" class="h-full w-full rounded-sm object-cover shadow-2xl" />
					<div class="absolute -bottom-6 -left-6 hidden max-w-xs border-l-4 border-accent bg-white p-8 shadow-xl md:block">
						<p class="font-display mb-2 text-2xl text-primary italic">"Sharp Minds. Steady Counsel."</p>
						<p class="font-sans text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-accent uppercase">— Established 2009</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="mt-24 bg-secondary p-12 text-center lg:p-20">
				<h2 class="font-display mb-6 text-4xl font-semibold text-primary">Built on True Partnership.</h2>
				<p class="mx-auto mb-10 max-w-3xl font-serif text-xl text-[#2e2e2e]">We measure success not in billable hours, but in the longevity of our client relationships.</p>
				<a href="/law/our-team" class="inline-block rounded-none bg-primary px-8 py-3.5 font-sans text-sm font-semibold tracking-widest text-white uppercase transition-all hover:bg-primary/90">Meet Our Attorneys</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</LawLayout>
